# Both containers ride along, and they stay separate files rather than one
# merged tree: the LuCI package's own control declares
# `adguardhome (>=0.107.73-r3)`, so shipping the interface without the daemon
# produces a menu entry that opens onto nothing. apk still records each of
# them separately, so either can be updated on its own.
